      "note": [
        "A dwelling refers to a room or a number of rooms intended for private habitation. \r\n  One- or two-dwelling building refers to detached one- or two-dwelling buildings as well as semi-detached, row and linked buildings. \r\n  Multi-dwelling building refers to buildings with three or more apartments, including balcony access housing. \r\n  Multi-dwelling buildings include special housing like housing for student, special housing for the elderly/disabled persons and other special housing.",
        "Correction 2025-08-25: Data for 2024 have been corrected for Gothenburg municipality, with a decrease of 389 dwellings in multi-dwelling buildings.",
        "Due to delays the figures are underestimated for the last quarter with about 20 to 60 percent. After one year the underestimation are about 2 percent."
